Bug found by the reviewer during the Phase 5 manual verification: pressing the fire ability left the button permanently dimmed and un-retriggerable. Cause was in main.ts, not in VehicleSystem - the render loop called motor/ring/fx/audio updates but never fleet.update(delta), so the 1.5s spray burst never expired and isBursting() stayed true. Fix is one line in the loop. Verified in the browser: busy trace 'BBBBBBB.........' (about 1.4s) then a successful re-fire. Lesson recorded: the burst clock was unit-tested but its driver was untested wiring, which is the blind spot this project's manual verification exists to cover.
